@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1) Get a dev token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice" }

### 2) List rooms (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/rooms

### 3) Who is online? (needs token)
GET {{host}}/api/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4) Start a background job - progress is pushed over SignalR to alice's connections
POST {{host}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Import claims.xlsx", "totalSteps": 15 }

### 5) Negotiate manually (what the JS client does first)
POST {{host}}/hubs/chat/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
